The clean invariant is to carry `(remaining integer sequence, current index, accumulator)` at the supplied semantics’ `#loop` head, with the real `Return` and frame-pop continuation still present. Encoding the arbitrary input as `intVals(IS:IntSeq)` lets each inductive head remain statically an `Int`; this avoids any unsafe cast or program-execution bridge while still representing every finite integer list.
apply patch
