The final reproducibility script is running end to end now. It rebuilds both backends, regenerates the translation, checks the verification macro’s expanded KORE is byte-identical to `solution.mpy`, runs both positive proofs, compares fixed-versus-extended concrete executions, and requires all three negative probes to fail.
